#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:3
#: 1358e159b74a49a6865973a30a4cfc10
msgid "Bain 路径（Bain Path）"
msgstr "Bain Path"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:5
#: 5e4c5bac001148e1ae11b1ac39ea99cd
msgid "**分类：** 晶格"
msgstr "**Category:** Lattice"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:7
#: d49b4b3524e34373abeab59a70437ca8
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:9
#: 8c49ab7aa8014297ad76d5c0f2200d98
msgid ""
"沿晶格 `a`、`b` 或 `c` 构造一条四方形变路径。默认扫描相对 `c/a = 0.95、1.00、1.05`，因此每个输入会得到 3 "
"个不同形状的结构，而不是只复制原结构。"
msgstr ""
"Construct a tetragonal deformation path along lattice vector `a`, `b`, or `c`. The "
"default relative `c/a` scan is `0.95, 1.00, 1.05`, so each input produces three "
"structures with different shapes instead of repeated copies of the original "
"structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:11
#: fa2c712b88934d43a818938c2c1f9a6d
msgid "卡片提供三种路径："
msgstr "The card provides three path types:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:13
#: b1e0bacc75f0420f83d6b92d5e4ce2f8
msgid "**恒体积**：改变四方形状，同时保持晶胞体积。"
msgstr "**Constant volume:** Change the tetragonal shape while preserving cell volume."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:14
#: c4b7fe2f06854952a360959051fd8309
msgid "**形状 × 体积网格**：每个形状点再组合一组相对体积。"
msgstr "**Shape × volume grid:** Combine each shape point with a set of relative volumes."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:15
#: 7401e6aa715645aaa89d07a11928116c
msgid "**自由四方轴**：只改变所选晶格矢量，另外两条保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"**Free tetragonal axis:** Change only the selected lattice vector and leave the other"
" two unchanged."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:18
#: e2c5940f213541bbaa5053a360c7e7df
msgid ""
"输入晶胞应提前按目标四方轴定向。这里的 `a / b / c` 是三条晶格矢量，不是笛卡尔 `x / y / z`；程序不会自动重定向或把任意原胞转换成标准 Bain "
"晶胞。"
msgstr ""
"Orient the input cell along the intended tetragonal axis before using this card. Here"
" `a / b / c` are lattice vectors, not Cartesian `x / y / z`. The program does not "
"reorient the cell automatically or convert an arbitrary primitive cell into a "
"standard Bain cell."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:21
#: aa7e8317dfa34a088c26a44280b7117f
msgid "工作原理"
msgstr "How It Works"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:23
#: f9836f89bf2e437583320330e3e99d3c
msgid "以相对 c/a 为路径坐标"
msgstr "Relative c/a as the Path Coordinate"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:25
#: 84836b7c1e5542d5a06f6d9fe6a47538
msgid "设 $q$ 是输出轴向／横向比例相对输入晶胞的倍数。`q=1` 保留输入比例，`q=1.05` 表示比例提高 5%。"
msgstr ""
"Let $q$ be the output axial-to-transverse ratio relative to that of the input cell. "
"`q=1` preserves the input ratio, while `q=1.05` increases the ratio by 5%."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:27
#: e6b2dbb7c6174e73ad8fa472a2e78907
msgid "恒体积模式对选中轴和两条横向晶格矢量分别使用"
msgstr ""
"Constant-volume mode applies the following factors to the selected axis and the two "
"transverse lattice vectors:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:29
#: 1cd4843561864b64ad2d25d3dd4a2d6e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"f_{\\parallel}=q^{2/3},\\qquad\n"
"f_{\\perp}=q^{-1/3}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:34
#: 8404873a29e54f9e907d49ccefaf1e73
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"因此 $f_{\\parallel}/f_{\\perp}=q$ 且 $f_{\\parallel}f_{\\perp}^2=1$：界面中的相对 `c/a` "
"就是真实比例变化，体积保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"Therefore, $f_{\\parallel}/f_{\\perp}=q$ and $f_{\\parallel}f_{\\perp}^2=1$. The "
"relative `c/a` shown in the interface is the actual ratio change, while the volume "
"remains constant."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:36
#: 5f174d365868457e86a31de5fe0091ca
#, python-brace-format
msgid "形状 × 体积模式再把三条晶格矢量统一乘以 $v^{1/3}$，所以"
msgstr ""
"Shape × volume mode additionally multiplies all three lattice vectors by $v^{1/3}$, "
"giving"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:38
#: 167635c543624da3a15467f6f8c2667b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\frac{V'}{V_0}=v.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:42
#: 4acc2d609dd245a6a1284d9d5d5db402
#, python-brace-format
msgid "自由四方轴模式使用 $f_{\\parallel}=q$、$f_{\\perp}=1$，此时体积也随 $q$ 改变。"
msgstr ""
"Free-tetragonal-axis mode uses $f_{\\parallel}=q$ and $f_{\\perp}=1$, so the volume "
"also changes with $q$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:44
#: c18e55cd8b5e42f1aae61d855a78de38
msgid "输出数量"
msgstr "Output Count"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:46
#: 6a7d0ac7b5c54fb5b6e6a0ff6aaf2d09
msgid "普通路径的输出数为"
msgstr "The output count for an ordinary path is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:48
#: 9f6710f33f8e4e618c9a493e681cb306
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{out}}=N_{\\mathrm{input}}N_q.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:52
#: ea73a96a5b584009bf7dc6cf6f8f4626
msgid "形状 × 体积网格的输出数为"
msgstr "The output count for a shape × volume grid is"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:54
#: aa03c83f0a7e41d39f917049c764450b
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{out}}=N_{\\mathrm{input}}N_qN_v.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:58
#: 06127013037a4f919120218a7888f683
msgid "界面会实时显示路径点数、体积点数和总输出数。"
msgstr ""
"The interface shows the number of path points, volume points, and total outputs in "
"real time."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:60
#: 1de5d1d2084b43c2a9f50d22ebb70b0b
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:62
#: 45ed96366b874479abae5ae38e23a754
msgid "近平衡三点路径"
msgstr "Three-Point Near-Equilibrium Path"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:64
#: 5463f6598eb84b689690bae5a663c4e8
msgid "输入已经按目标四方轴定向的结构。"
msgstr "Use an input structure already oriented along the target tetragonal axis."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:65
#: 8ba55420f8e341b6927201a4bfd1964f
msgid "选择四方轴，例如晶格 `c`。"
msgstr "Choose the tetragonal axis, such as lattice vector `c`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:66
#: e18c6ac5c1754ad1b6eff2b2c57cb976
msgid "保持路径坐标为“相对 c/a”、模式为“恒体积”。"
msgstr "Keep the path coordinate at `Relative c/a` and the mode at `Constant volume`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:67
#: 8e1638bceb244514b8041518b6508194
msgid "使用默认范围 `0.95 → 1.05，步长 0.05`。"
msgstr "Use the default range `0.95 → 1.05` with a step of `0.05`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:68
#: 6c968b6c5a8f4ec7a0def9aa0725c3ee
msgid "保持“原子随晶胞移动”开启。"
msgstr "Keep `Move atoms with cell` enabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:70
#: 853d581fbfe44d47b96935e20544b6d3
msgid "若载入 8 个结构，界面会显示 `8 × 3 = 24` 个输出。每个输入生成压缩、原始和拉伸三个形状点。"
msgstr ""
"With eight loaded structures, the interface shows `8 × 3 = 24` outputs. Each input "
"produces compressed, original-ratio, and elongated shape points."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:72
#: 10559277b1824f44891de5cb1164bcf6
msgid "需要同时覆盖体积响应时，选择“形状 × 体积网格”。例如 3 个形状点和 `0.95、1.00、1.05` 三个体积点，会为每个输入生成 `3 × 3 = 9` 个输出。"
msgstr ""
"To cover volume response as well, choose `Shape × volume grid`. For example, three "
"shape points combined with volume points `0.95, 1.00, 1.05` produce `3 × 3 = 9` "
"outputs per input."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:74
#: 07a29cccc78b4c568af48077799cbf5a
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:76
#: 263adb6116bb4beaab0ca6d8871a17ab
msgid "路径定义"
msgstr "Path Definition"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:78
#: 4800a98c18bb4e0689086c1353d98432
msgid "四方轴（axis）"
msgstr "Tetragonal Axis (axis)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:80
#: 5f9689dc8e0142e8920782d54f7cde31
msgid "默认晶格 `c`。选择第一、第二或第三条晶格矢量作为四方轴；保存值继续使用 `x / y / z` 以兼容已有工作流。"
msgstr ""
"Default lattice vector `c`. Select the first, second, or third lattice vector as the "
"tetragonal axis. Serialized values remain `x / y / z` for compatibility with existing"
" workflows."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:82
#: 5b46cbf7ba344fbca35244ea1a2ad2bb
msgid "路径坐标（coordinate_mode）"
msgstr "Path Coordinate (coordinate_mode)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:84
#: 0d33ab8aa411451c896b64e34f4b91a7
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"默认 `relative_ca`，表示真实的相对轴向／横向比例。`axis_scale` 是旧工作流使用的轴向直接缩放因子：恒体积时选中轴乘 $s$，横向各乘 "
"$s^{-1/2}$，实际相对 `c/a` 为 $s^{3/2}$。"
msgstr ""
"Default `relative_ca`, representing the actual relative axial-to-transverse ratio. "
"`axis_scale` is the direct axial scale used by legacy workflows: at constant volume, "
"the selected axis is multiplied by $s$ and each transverse axis by $s^{-1/2}$, so the"
" actual relative `c/a` is $s^{3/2}$."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:86
#: cd69c7cd392242f0a0f6d09acaa25e96
msgid "旧 JSON 没有该字段时会自动按 `axis_scale` 恢复，保证原有几何行为不变；新建卡片使用 `relative_ca`。"
msgstr ""
"When this field is absent from legacy JSON, the card restores `axis_scale` semantics "
"automatically so the original geometry is unchanged. Newly created cards use "
"`relative_ca`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:88
#: e54ef2f70ac34e6cbf390c6aeb97a291
msgid "相对 c/a 扫描（ca_range）"
msgstr "Relative c/a Scan (ca_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:90
#: 91770d7f05ed42f2a9636cb18940c13b
msgid "默认 `(0.95, 1.05, 0.05)`，依次填写起点、终点和正步长。终点小于起点时会自动交换；所有路径值必须大于 0。"
msgstr ""
"Default `(0.95, 1.05, 0.05)`, containing the start, end, and positive step in that "
"order. Reversed endpoints are swapped automatically, and every path value must be "
"greater than zero."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:92
#: d3cb1b6ba1044cb4a1792d94bd93d1b3
msgid "路径模式（mode）"
msgstr "Path Mode (mode)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:94
#: 6a58acfad5f0435095218c610b58e1e3
msgid "`constant_volume`：恒体积四方路径。"
msgstr "`constant_volume`: Constant-volume tetragonal path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:95
#: c6e715da783f4d30bc50312058cceb71
msgid "`scale_volume`：形状与体积的笛卡尔积。"
msgstr "`scale_volume`: Cartesian product of shape and volume points."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:96
#: 4c522f5961884948916d34cbf20a5427
msgid "`free_c`：只改变所选晶格矢量。"
msgstr "`free_c`: Change only the selected lattice vector."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:98
#: ba265253d3a8444bada1c979c6d34edc
msgid "相对体积扫描（volume_scale_range）"
msgstr "Relative Volume Scan (volume_scale_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:100
#: 38c9a2eb703b4d96904ad5ccf0692b62
msgid "默认 `(1, 1, 1)`，仅在 `scale_volume` 中显示并生效。`1.0` 表示输入体积，`0.95` 表示输入体积的 95%。"
msgstr ""
"Default `(1, 1, 1)`, shown and used only in `scale_volume` mode. `1.0` means the "
"input volume, while `0.95` means 95% of the input volume."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:102
#: 5094789a87af40d2bb11f98f519a712f
msgid "原子坐标"
msgstr "Atomic Coordinates"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:104
#: ba68614d317d4ceb85221ddeafdbfe8d
msgid "原子随晶胞移动（scale_atoms）"
msgstr "Move Atoms with Cell (scale_atoms)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:106
#: 5f084dce72964ca89ff81b78ddf6c2ab
msgid "默认开启：保持分数坐标，原子随晶胞仿射变形。关闭后保持笛卡尔坐标，只改变周期晶胞；这可能改变跨边界近邻关系，应有明确物理目的再使用。"
msgstr ""
"Enabled by default: fractional coordinates remain fixed and atoms follow the cell's "
"affine deformation. When disabled, Cartesian coordinates remain fixed and only the "
"periodic cell changes. This can alter neighbor relationships across periodic "
"boundaries and should be used only for a specific physical purpose."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:108
#: 3acdffc3cf8b4b9098a1e9f8ad89411d
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:110
#: a016029ff3cd47fca0aa59c01e2102c6
msgid "**为什么相对 c/a 填 1.2 后，所选晶格矢量不是直接变成 1.2 倍？**"
msgstr ""
"**Why does setting relative c/a to 1.2 not multiply the selected lattice vector "
"directly by 1.2?**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:112
#: 90068084834a472b9b6c227a3e307984
#, python-brace-format
msgid "恒体积路径需要同时补偿横向晶格。轴向乘 $1.2^{2/3}$、横向乘 $1.2^{-1/3}$，二者的相对比例正好改变 1.2 倍。"
msgstr ""
"A constant-volume path must compensate through the transverse lattice vectors. The "
"axial direction is multiplied by $1.2^{2/3}$ and each transverse direction by "
"$1.2^{-1/3}$, changing their relative ratio by exactly 1.2."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:114
#: 89dad00b6d9e4510a23120eb472bcaa0
msgid "**为什么没有显示体积扫描？**"
msgstr "**Why is the volume scan not shown?**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:116
#: 284ac943f7804fad9eadf0f25e111cf1
msgid "它只参与“形状 × 体积网格”。恒体积和自由四方轴模式各自已经确定体积变化规则。"
msgstr ""
"It is used only by `Shape × volume grid`. Constant-volume and free-tetragonal-axis "
"modes already define their own volume behavior."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:118
#: 2678dc8bd9914a198696ae2176b66cd7
msgid "**为什么旧工作流显示“轴向缩放（旧版）”？**"
msgstr "**Why does an old workflow show `Axial scale (legacy)`?**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:120
#: 43f399f0ae524c2d89e35ca7d5538ff8
msgid "旧版本把 `ca_range` 当作直接轴向缩放因子。卡片会保留该计算语义，避免载入旧 JSON 后静默改变结构。"
msgstr ""
"Older versions treated `ca_range` as a direct axial scale factor. The card preserves "
"that calculation to avoid silently changing structures when legacy JSON is loaded."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:122
#: c18e55cd8b5e42f1aae61d855a78de38
msgid "输出"
msgstr "Output"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/bain-path-card.md:124
#: 1b2a861504c74c48b4d572295a5ca743
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"新语义标签为 `Bain(ax={axis},ca={ca},V={V/V0},mode={mode})`；旧轴向缩放语义使用 "
"`s={s}`。该操作无随机性，同一输入和参数会得到相同输出。"
msgstr ""
"The current label is `Bain(ax={axis},ca={ca},V={V/V0},mode={mode})`; legacy axial-"
"scale semantics use `s={s}`. The operation has no randomness, so identical inputs and"
" parameters produce identical outputs."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "这张卡不是随机扰动卡。它扫描的是晶胞形状自由度：选定 `x`、`y` 或 `z` 作为 c "
#~ "轴，按 `ca_range` 改变该方向长度；`constant_volume` "
#~ "会同步缩放另外两条轴让体积保持不变，`scale_volume` 会在此基础上再扫体积，`free_c` 只改选中轴。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "This is not a random perturbation card. "
#~ "It scans cell-shape degrees of freedom. "
#~ "Choose `x`, `y`, or `z` as the c "
#~ "axis and vary its length with `ca_range`. "
#~ "`constant_volume` compensates with the other two "
#~ "axes, `scale_volume` adds a volume scan, and"
#~ " `free_c` changes only the selected axis."

#~ msgid "先做 constant-volume Bain，再按 `volume_scale_range` 统一缩放体积"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Apply a constant-volume Bain distortion, then"
#~ " scale volume according to `volume_scale_range`"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "这个参数只在 `mode = \"scale_volume\"` 时生效。比如 `[0.95, "
#~ "1.05, 0.05]` 会为每个 `c/a` 生成 0.95、1.00、1.05 "
#~ "三个体积点；如果 `ca_range` 有 5 个点，总输出就是 15 "
#~ "个结构。范围别一上来开太大，体积和形状同时扫很容易把训练集放大。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "This parameter is used only when `mode ="
#~ " \"scale_volume\"`. For example, `[0.95, 1.05, "
#~ "0.05]` produces volume ratios 0.95, 1.00, and"
#~ " 1.05 for each `c/a`; five `ca_range` "
#~ "points therefore produce 15 structures. Start "
#~ "with a narrow range because simultaneous shape"
#~ " and volume scans grow quickly."

#~ msgid "生效条件：`mode` 必须是 `scale_volume`。"
#~ msgstr "Active only when `mode` is `scale_volume`."

#~ msgid "适合怀疑模型同时缺体积响应和四方畸变响应时使用，输出数量是 `ca_range` 点数乘以体积点数。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Use when both volume and tetragonal response"
#~ " appear undersampled. Output count is the "
#~ "number of `ca_range` points times the number"
#~ " of volume points."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**体积没有保持不变。** 检查 `mode` 是否为 `constant_volume`。`free_c` "
