#~ msgid ""
#~ "沿一个指定晶轴做四方畸变，生成一组不同 `c/a` 比的晶胞。它保留原子数和元素组成，只改变晶格矢量，可用于给 "
#~ "bcc/fcc/fct 转变、四方相变路径、近似马氏体变形等场景补训练结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Apply a tetragonal distortion along a selected"
#~ " cell axis to generate cells with different"
#~ " `c/a` ratios. The operation preserves atom "
#~ "count and composition and changes only the "
#~ "lattice vectors. Use it to sample bcc/fcc/fct"
#~ " transformations, tetragonal transition paths, and "
#~ "approximate martensitic deformations."

