#~ msgid ""
#~ "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 重训后重新扫同一 Bain "
#~ "路径，能量曲线应更平滑，峰值位置不应随采样点轻微移动而大幅跳变。如果仍然不稳，缩小步长到 0.05 或在 "
#~ "`scale_volume` 模式下给每个 `c/a` 加入 0.95、1.00、1.05 三个体积点。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**How to verify the improvement:** After "
#~ "retraining, rescan the same Bain path. The "
#~ "energy curve should be smoother and peak "
#~ "positions should not jump after small changes"
#~ " in sampling points. If it remains "
#~ "unstable, reduce the step to 0.05 or use"
#~ " `scale_volume` to add volume ratios 0.95, "
#~ "1.00, and 1.05 at every `c/a`."

